    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Face of Horror"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In this stunning, blood-soaked homage to Technicolor horror films, a woman in medieval England rises from the grave to wreak revenge on her husband."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/hot-spot-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Hot Spot"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new film from the acclaimed director of The Silent Twins is a daring and distinctive sci-fi thriller set in a near-future society ruled by sentient AI."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/blood-countess-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Queens of the Night: Female Vampires on Screen"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Step into the seductive, dangerous and ever-evolving world of cinema's most captivating immortal: the female vampire."
    }
  ]
